round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 inline ml-1 align-top opacity-70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></p><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">What we looked for:</strong></h2><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">ANC Quality:</strong> Does it block low hums <em>and</em> voices?</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Battery Life:</strong> Can it survive a long-haul flight?</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Comfort:</strong> Can you wear it for 4 hours without pain?</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">UAE Availability:</strong> Is it in stock with a warranty?</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Here are the top 10 winners ranked by performance and value.</p></div><div class=\"mb-12 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden font-sans\"><div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-5 border-b border-gray-200 flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-indigo-50 text-primary rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-indigo-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trophy w-8 h-8 stroke-[2.0px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 1-.976 1.696A5 5 0 0 0 7 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M14 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 0 .976 1.696A5 5 0 0 1 17 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h1.5a1 1 0 0 0 0-5H18\"></path><path d=\"M4 22h16\"></path><path d=\"M6 9a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3a1 1