00+ hours of playtime. A unique on-ear alternative.<!-- -->&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border-t border-amber-200 p-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 w-full sm:w-auto text-center sm:text-left\"><span class=\"text-[14px] font-black text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-tight flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg>Approx. Price:</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-emerald-700 tracking-tight\">AED 319</span></div><div class=\"w-full sm:w-auto transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 duration-200\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4qV6Vub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-500 text-black font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm text-center transition-colors\">Check Price on <!-- -->Amazon.ae<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></article><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center py-2 opacity-40\"><div class=\"w-12