\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/29c50a58537b57b13b9599a52952204e52f1d8dd-1119x1500.jpg\\\"],\\\"brand\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Soundcore\\\"},\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"price\\\":179,\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/4t1iDWf\\\",\\\"priceValidUntil\\\":\\\"2027-02-04\\\",\\\"seller\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\"}},\\\"aggregateRating\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"AggregateRating\\\",\\\"ratingValue\\\":4.5,\\\"reviewCount\\\":89877,\\\"bestRating\\\":5,\\\"worstRating\\\":1}}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":9,\\\"item\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Product\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Marshall Major V On-Ear Headphone\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/marshall-major-v-bluetooth-headphone\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The style icon. With a massive 100+ hours of battery and wireless charging, this is for those who value aesthetics and rock music over pure silence.\\\",\\\"image\\\":[\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/449a767ecc604286322bcc5e6c4589041b284ac9-581x806.jpg\\\"],\\\"brand\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Marshall\\\"},\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"price\\\":319,\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/4qV6Vub\\\",\\\"priceValidUntil\\\":\\\"2027-02-04\\\",\\\"seller\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\"}},\\\"aggregateRating\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"AggregateRating\\\",\\\"ratingValue\\\":4.6,\\\"reviewCount\\\":5299,\\\"bestRating\\\":5,\\\"worstRating\\\":1}}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":10,\\\"item\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Product\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"JBL Tune 780NC Wireless Headphone\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/jbl-tune-780nc-wireless-headphone\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The upgraded sibling to the 770NC. It features the latest Bluetooth 6.0 and an even longer 76-hour battery life for power users.\\\",\\\"image\\\":[\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/3ed6b8bebd10e6d758340bf2d75460312ce83812-1275x1367.jpg\\\"],\\\"brand\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"JBL\\\"},\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"price\\\":403.73,\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/3LEx8y3\\\",\\\"priceValidUntil\\\":\\\"2027-02-04\\\",\\\"seller\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\"}},\\\"aggregateRating\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"AggregateRating\\\",\\\"ratingValue\\\":4.3,\\\"reviewCount\\\":26490,\\\"bestRating\\\":5,\\\"worstRating\\\":1}}}]},{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which noise-cancelling headphones are best for the gym?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"For the gym, you need headphones that are secure and sweat-resistant. The Sony WH-CH720N is our top pick because it is incredibly lightweight (192g) and stable. If you prefer a premium option, the Sennheiser Momentum 4 has a tight clamping force that stays in place during workouts, though we generally recommend earbuds for intense cardio to avoid overheating ears.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Does Emirates provide noise-cancelling headphones?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Emirates only provides high-quality noise-cancelling headphones in Business and First Class (Bowers \\u0026 Wilkins in some First Class cabins). In the economy, you are typically given standard headsets with poor isolation. For a long-haul flight, bringing your own pair like the Bose QuietComfort Ultra or Sony XM6 is highly recommended to block out the engine drone effectively.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the best affordable noise-cancelling headphone in UAE?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Based on Amazon.ae sales data for 2026, the Soundcore Life Q30 is the undisputed budget champion. For under AED 200, it offers Hi-Res audio and 3 modes of active noise cancellation. If you can stretch your budget slightly, the Soundcore Space Q45 adds LDAC support and better build quality for around AED 300.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which is better: ANC or ENC?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"They serve different purposes. ANC (Active Noise Cancellation) is for you—it uses microphones to cancel out external noise so you can hear music in silence. ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) is for the person you are calling—it isolates your voice so the other person doesn't hear the coffee shop around you. The best headsets, like the Sony WH-1000XM6, feature excellent performance in both categories.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Are the Sony WH-1000XM6 worth the upgrade over the XM5?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, specifically for the UAE climate and travel. The XM6 features the new QN3 processor which handles high-frequency noise (like AC hum and chatter) significantly better than the XM5. It also features improved heat management in the earcups, making them more comfortable for outdoor use in Dubai.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I use Bluetooth headphones with in-flight entertainment?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Most older planes still use a 2-pin audio jack. However, many modern headphones (like the Sony XM6 and Bose Ultra) come with a 3.5mm backup cable included in the box. For wireless connection to the plane's TV, you can buy a cheap \\\\\\\"Bluetooth Transmitter\\\\\\\" dongle from Amazon.ae, or fly on newer aircraft like the Emirates A350, which support direct Bluetooth pairing.\\\"}}]}]}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"20:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$2a\\\"}}],\\\"$L2b\\\"]\\n22:null\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"26:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Top 10 Best Noise-Cancelling Headphones in UAE 2026: For... | TopTenUAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Whether you need to block out the roar of a Dubai Metro commute or silence the jet engines on an Emirates flight, Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a...\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"application-name\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"TopTenUAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"manifest\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/manifest.json\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"keywords\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"best in UAE,top 10 UAE,Dubai reviews,buying guide UAE,UAE rankings\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"creator\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"TopTenUAE Editorial Team\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"publisher\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"TopTenUAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"robots\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"index, follow\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"googlebot\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"category\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"top-ten\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"article:publisher\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"article:pub