,{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"5e42eb8f993d\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"—it isolates your voice so the other person doesn't hear the coffee shop around you. The best headsets, like the \\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"3fe9529fe275\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[\\\"strong\\\"],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Sony WH-1000XM6\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"0a84a44e5b12\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\", feature excellent performance in both categories.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Which is better: ANC or ENC?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"bc4882011735\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"ce647dfaa927\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"a3f0354ccd84\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, specifically for the UAE climate and travel. The \\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"f958f09ea593\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[\\\"strong\\\"],\\\"text\\\":\\\"XM6\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"a217e56eb8db\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\" features the new QN3 processor which handles high-frequency noise (like AC hum and chatter) significantly better than the XM5. It also features improved heat management in the earcups, making them more comfortable for outdoor use in Dubai.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Are the Sony WH-1000XM6 worth the upgrade over the XM5?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"b72ae4ffca0b\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"3c86c6284763\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"f0814449ea92\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Most older planes still use a 2-pin audio jack. However, many modern headphones (like the \\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"ea7fd02ca2be\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[\\\"strong\\\"],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Sony XM6\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"e23619eb8943\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\" and \\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"8d1503e9b25f\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[\\\"strong\\\"],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Bose Ultra\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"8dfe1a9e4bf1\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\") come with a 3.5mm backup cable included in the box. For wireless connection to the plane's TV, you can buy a cheap \\\\\\\"Bluetooth Transmitter\\\\\\\" dongle from Amazon.ae, or fly on newer aircraft like the Emirates A350, which support direct Bluetooth pairing.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I use Bluetooth headphones with in-flight entertainment?\\\"}],\\\"intro\\\":\\\"Whether you need to block out the roar of a Dubai Metro commute or silence the jet engines on an Emirates flight, Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a non-negotiable feature in 2026. We analyzed the top-selling models on Amazon.ae to bring you the definitive guide to the best headphones for every budget.\\\",\\\"listItems\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"00b4ae38a429\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"Best Overall\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"product\\\",\\\"address\\\":null,\\\"affiliateLink\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/49c4ehH\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"brand\\\":\\\"Sony\\\",\\\"code\\\":null,\\\"cons\\\":[\\\"Ear pads prone to staining (Silver model)\\\",\\\"No aptX Lossless codec support\\\",\\\"Bluetooth stability issues reported\\\"],\\\"country\\\":null,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"curriculum\\\":null,\\\"customerRating\\\":4.4,\\\"entityType\\\":null,\\\"feeRange\\\":null,\\\"heroFeature\\\":null,\\\"keyFeatures\\\":[\\\"HD Processor QN3 (7x faster than XM5)\\\",\\\"12-Microphone System\\\",\\\"30-Hour Battery Life\\\",\\\"New Foldable Design\\\",\\\"Multipoint Connection\\\"],\\\"location\\\":null,\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Sony WH-1000XM6 black foldable headphones side view\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/aaf7ffe536e9ada28532b32ba76c7ce520462fb5-991x1500.jpg\\\"},\\\"price\\\":1122.4,\\\"priceTier\\\":\\\"Premium\\\",\\\"pros\\\":[\\\"Industry-leading Noise Cancellation\\\",\\\"Folds compact for travel\\\",\\\"Extremely comfortable for long flights\\\",\\\"Quick Charge (3 mins = 3 hours playback)\\\"],\\\"rating\\\":4.4,\\\"realityCheck\\\":null,\\\"retailer\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\",\\\"reviewCount\\\":1938,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"sony-wh-1000xm6-wireless-headphone\\\",\\\"specifications\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Sony WH-1000XM6 Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"The new king of silence. With 12 microphones and the QN3 processor, this is the absolute best choice for frequent flyers and open-office workers who need total isolation.\\\",\\\"website\\\":null},\\\"rank\\\":1,\\\"whySelected\\\":\\\"The undisputed market leader with the new QN3 processor and 12 microphones, offering the best isolation for office and travel.\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"fb252432c72b\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"Best Comfort\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"product\\\",\\\"address\\\":null,\\\"affiliateLink\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/49YjtLC\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"brand\\\":\\\"Bose\\\",\\\"code\\\":null,\\\"cons\\\":[\\\"App connectivity issues\\\",\\\"Pricey\\\"],\\\"country\\\":null,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"curriculum\\\":null,\\\"customerRating\\\":4.2,\\\"entityType\\\":null,\\\"feeRange\\\":null,\\\"heroFeature\\\":null,\\\"keyFeatures\\\":[\\\"Spatialized Audio\\\",\\\"CustomTune Technology\\\",\\\"24-Hour Battery\\\",\\\"Lossless USB Audio\\\"],\\\"location\\\":null,\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Gen 2 Black\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/8870e8d327c2b6aa0700a56e6e03392cb54629fd-816x1016.jpg\\\"},\\\"price\\\":1474.25,\\\"priceTier\\\":\\\"Premium\\\",\\\"pros\\\":[\\\"Extremely comfortable\\\",\\\"Immersive audio mode\\\",\\\"Foldable design\\\"],\\\"rating\\\":4.2,\\\"realityCheck\\\":null,\\\"retailer\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\",\\\"reviewCount\\\":7464,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"bose-quietcomfort-ultra-wireless-headphone\\\",\\\"specifications\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones (Gen 2)\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"The comfort champion. If you fly long-haul (14+ hours) and sensitive ears are your main concern, the plush cushions and \\\\\\\"Immersive Audio\\\\\\\" make these the winner.\\\",\\\"website\\\":null},\\\"rank\\\":2,\\\"whySelected\\\":\\\"Bose remains the king of comfort. The \\\\\\\"Immersive Audio\\\\\\\" and plush earcups make this the only choice for ultra-long flights.\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"8a7e6c1f9177\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"Best Premium\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"product\\\",\\\"address\\\":null,\\\"affiliateLink\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/4qYBAa5\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"brand\\\":\\\"Apple\\\",\\\"code\\\":null,\\\"cons\\\":[\\\"Heavier than Sony/Bose\\\",\\\"Case offers poor protection\\\"],\\\"country\\\":null,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"curriculum\\\":null,\\\"customerRating\\\":4.3,\\\"entityType\\\":null,\\\"feeRange\\\":null,\\\"heroFeature\\\":null,\\\"keyFeatures\\\":[\\\"Personalized Spatial Audio\\\",\\\"Transparency Mode\\\",\\\"USB-C Charging\\\",\\\"Digital Crown Control\\\"],\\\"location\\\":null,\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Apple AirPods Max Midnight Blue USB-C\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/6b04713c8b53e0942621d6d594841a0097d23ba3-1355x1500.jpg\\\"},\\\"price\\\":1799,\\\"priceTier\\\":\\\"Premium\\\",\\\"pros\\\":[\\\"Seamless Apple pairing\\\",\\\"Incredible build quality\\\",\\\"Best transparency mode\\\"],\\\"rating\\\":4.3,\\\"realityCheck\\\":null,\\\"retailer\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\",\\\"reviewCount\\\":127,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"apple-airpods-max-usb-c-wireless-headphone\\\",\\\"specifications\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Apple AirPods Max (USB-C) Headphone\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"The ultimate luxury choice for iPhone users. The build quality is unmatched, and the Transparency Mode is so natural it feels like you aren't wearing headphones.\\\",\\\"website\\\":null},\\\"rank\\\":3,\\\"whySelected\\\":\\\"For iPhone users, the ecosystem integration is magic. The build quality and Transparency Mode are unmatched in the industry.\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"916d4c5862b7\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"Battery King\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"product\\\",\\\"address\\\":null,\\\"affiliateLink\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/45IoPrW\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"brand\\\":\\\"Sennheiser\\\",\\\"code\\\":null,\\\"cons\\\":[\\\"Touch controls can be finicky\\\",\\\"ANC weaker than Sony\\\"],\\\"country\\\":null,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"curriculum\\\":null,\\\"customerRating\\\":4.2,\\\"entityType\\\":null,\\\"feeRange\\\":null,\\\"heroFeature\\\":null,\\\"keyFeatures\\\":[\\\"60-Hour Battery\\\",\\\"Audiophile Sound\\\",\\\"Adaptive ANC\\\",\\\"Smart Control App\\\"],\\\"location\\\":null,\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Sennheiser Momentum 4 Black Wireless Headphones\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/88be18c415000a243c1f8e7f1abb277a96befd4b-1093x1500.jpg\\\"},\\\"price\\\":849,\\\"priceTier\\\":\\\"Mid-Range\\\",\\\"pros\\\":[\\\"Insane battery life\\\",\\\"Rich sound quality\\\",\\\"Great value price\\\"],\\\"rating\\\":4.2,\\\"realityCheck\\\":null,\\\"retailer\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\",\\\"reviewCount\\\":8888,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"sennheiser-momentum-4-wireless-headphone\\\",\\\"specifications\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Sennheiser Momentum 4 Wireless Headphone\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"The battery beast. With 60 hours of playtime, you can fly from Dubai to Los Angeles and back twice without charging. The sound quality is audiophile-grade.\\\",\\\"website\\\":null},\\\"r