 leading-tight tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Top 10 Best Noise-Cancelling Headphones in UAE 2026: For Travel & Work\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 gap-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-900\",\"children\":\"Last Updated:\"}],[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"dateTime\":\"2026-01-16T14:32:00.000Z\",\"children\":\"16 January 2026\"}]]}]}],false]}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",null,{\"data\":{\"_type\":\"topTenList\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"300cea4e109f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e4912a5d8653\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"In 2026, headphone technology has made a massive leap. We are seeing budget models under AED 300 offering features that used to cost AED 1000, like App control and Multipoint connection. Meanwhile, flagships from Sony and Bose are pushing the boundaries with AI-driven noise suppression and spatial audio.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"1d2e2231d90b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fe94c768e1e6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"While over-ear headphones offer superior noise cancellation for travel, they can be bulky for daily commutes. If you prefer a more compact audio solution that fits in your pocket, check out our ranked list of the \"},{\"_key\":\"17bebaa6bd8d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"7d516b5fc4a4\"],\"text\":\"Best Wireless .Earbuds in UAE\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"7d516b5fc4a4\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"blank\":false,\"href\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/best-wireless-earbuds-uae/\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"544c60fbe58b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0c9d439fba1b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"What we looked for:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"b180ce6f8f4f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"214f9ee22c5f\",\"_type