The \"},{\"_key\":\"e78f0679d9f2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Soundcore Q30\"},{\"_key\":\"5e0eaa16b567\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or \"},{\"_key\":\"7a7f92d2eb41\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"JBL Tune 770NC\"},{\"_key\":\"3e6e64d63108\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" offer 90% of the performance for 20% of the price.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5b5f7dea9b55\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fb9bfdabd466\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Note: Prices and stock availability on Amazon.ae change frequently. The prices listed above were accurate at the time of review.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7c13d4cfabdc\",\"_type\":\"relatedLink\",\"label\":\"Best Wireless Earbuds in UAE\",\"preText\":\"Prefer a lighter, pocket-sized option for the gym or daily commute? Check out our ranking of the:\",\"targetPost\":{\"_ref\":\"4a6f3748-947a-4be2-b5f3-91deed323433\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}}],\"faqs\":[{\"_key\":\"c39f5908f8e9\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"b9d1a7fc1890\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"435653dac04e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For the gym, you need headphones that are secure and sweat-resistant. The \"},{\"_key\":\"de968bca0c29\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Sony WH-CH720N\"},{\"_key\":\"ded0ae11c46e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is our top pick because it is incredibly lightweight (192g) and stable. If you prefer a premium option, the \"},{\"_key\":\"01c940178c4d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Sennheiser Momentum 4\"},{\"_key\":\"3099e8c68f86\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" has a tight clamping force that stays in place during workouts, though we generally recommend earbuds for intense cardio to avoid overheating ears.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Which noise-cancelling headphones are best for the gym?\"},{\"_key\":\"e9dd386ed3d2\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"919dd9ac35cf\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6be49e0129ea\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Emirates only provides high-quality noise-cancelling headphones in \"},{\"_key\":\"96250dc689b1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Business and First Class\"},{\"_key\":\"4190c49b8381\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (Bowers & Wilkins in some First Class cabins). In the economy, you are typically given standard headsets with poor isolation. For a long-haul flight, bringing your own pair like the \"},{\"_key\":\"6f12e2beaa4e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Bose QuietComfort Ultra\"},{\"_key\":\"475726c9996a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or \"},{\"_key\":\"ea86927b5467\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Sony XM6\"},{\"_key\":\"d986c2a37b8b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is highly recommended to block out the engine drone effectively.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Does Emirates provide noise-cancelling headphones?\"},{\"_key\":\"c4e270757789\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"2de4568cc08f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"62db29d33081\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Based on Amazon.ae sales data for 2026, the \"},{\"_key\":\"6c0f5285dbf6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Soundcore Life Q30\"},{\"_key\":\"1bde824d2a9d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is the undisputed budget champion. For under AED 200, it offers Hi-Res audio and 3 modes of active noise cancellation. If you can stretch your budget slightly, the \"},{\"_key\":\"4516086267bd\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Soundcore Space Q45\"},{\"_key\":\"8ef8d9b18238\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" adds LDAC support and better build quality for around AED 300.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the best affordable noise-cancelling headphone in UAE?\"},{\"_key\":\"b99b0ea1b202\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"4885a1389426\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5dbcda82a23f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"They serve different purposes. \"},{\"_key\":\"1a7e0ba047b4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"ANC (Active Noise Cancellation)\"},{\"_key\":\"0d5abdf9daed\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is for \"},{\"_key\":\"58600323a168\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"you\"},{\"_key\":\"da44ca659c4e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"—it uses microphones to cancel out external noise so you can hear music in silence. \"},{\"_key\":\"0ecc6d8bae7d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)\"},{\"_key\":\"6d44bf984380\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is for \"},{\"_key\":\"838991cf9f19\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"the person you are calling\"},{\"_key\":\"5e42eb8f993d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"—it isolates your voice so the other person doesn't hear the coffee shop around you. The best headsets, like the \"},{\"_key\":\"3fe9529fe275\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Sony WH-1000XM6\"},{\"_key\":\"0a84a44e5b12\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", feature excellent performance in both categories.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Which is better: ANC or ENC?\"},{\"_key\":\"bc4882011735\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"ce647dfaa927\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a3f0354ccd84\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Yes, specifically for the UAE climate and travel. The \"},{\"_key\":\"f958f09ea593\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"XM6\"},{\"_key\":\"a217e56eb8db\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" features the new QN3 processor which handles high-frequency noise (like AC hum and chatter) significantly better than the XM5. It also features improved heat management in the earcups, making them more comfortable for outdoor use in Dubai.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Are the Sony WH-1000XM6 worth the upgrade over the XM5?\"},{\"_key\":\"b72ae4ffca0b\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"3c86c6284763\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f0814449ea92\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Most older planes still use a 2-pin audio jack. However, many modern headphones (like the \"},{\"_key\":\"ea7fd02ca2be\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Sony XM6\"},{\"_key\":\"e23619eb8943\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and \"},{\"_key\":\"8d1503e9b25f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Bose Ultra\"},{\"_key\":\"8dfe1a9e4bf1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\") come with a 3.5mm backup cable included in the box. For wireless connection to the plane's TV, you can buy a cheap \\\"Bluetooth Transmitter\\\" dongle from Amazon.ae, or fly on newer aircraft like the Emirates A350, which support direct Bluetooth pairing.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Can I use Bluetooth headphones with in-flight entertainment?\"}],\"intro\":\"Whether you need to block out the roar of a Dubai Metro commute or silence the jet engines on an Emirates flight, Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a non-negotiable feature in 2026. We analyzed the top-selling models on Amazon.ae to bring you the definitive guide to the best headphones for every budget.\",\"listItems\":[{\"_key\":\"00b4ae38a429\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Overall\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/49c4ehH\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Sony\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Ear pads prone to staining (Silver model)\",\"No aptX Lossless codec support\",\"Bluetooth stability issues reported\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.4,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"HD Processor QN3 (7x faster than XM5)\",\"12-Microphone System\",\"30-Hour Battery Life\",\"New Foldable Design\",\"Multipoint Connection\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sony WH-1000XM6 black foldable headphones side view\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/aaf7ffe536e9ada28532b32ba76c7ce520462fb5-991x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":1122.4,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Industry-leading Noise Cancellation\",\"Folds compact for travel\",\"Extremely comfortable for long flights\",\"Quick Charge (3 mins = 3 hours playback)\"],\"rating\":4.4,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":1938,\"slug\":\"sony-wh-1000xm6-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Sony WH-1000XM6 Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones\",\"verdict\":\"The new king of silence. With 12 microphones and the QN3 processor, this is the absolute best choice for frequent flyers and open-office workers who need total isolation.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":1,\"whySelected\":\"The undisputed market leader with the new QN3 processor and 12 microphones, offering the best isolation for office and travel.\"},{\"_key\":\"fb252432c72b\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Comfort\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/49YjtLC\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Bose\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"App connectivity issues\",\"Pricey\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.2,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Spatialized Audio\",\"CustomTune Technology\",\"24-Hour Battery\",\"Lossless USB Audio\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Gen 2 Black\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/8870e8d327c2b6aa0700a56e6e03392cb54629fd-816x1016.jpg\"},\"price\":1474.25,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Extremely comfortable\",\"Immersive audio mode\",\"Foldable design\"],\"rating\":4.2,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":7464,\"slug\":\"bose-quietcomfort-ultra-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones (Gen 2)\",\"verdict\":\"The comfort champion. If you fly long-haul (14+ hours) and sensitive ears are your main concern, the plush cushions and \\\"Immersive Audio\\\" make these the winner.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":2,\"whySelected\":\"Bose remains the king of comfort. The \\\"Immersive Audio\\\" and plush earcups make this the only choice for ultra-long flights.\"},{\"_key\":\"8a7e6c1f9177\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Premium\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4qYBAa5\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Apple\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Heavier than Sony/Bose\",\"Case offers poor protection\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.3,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Personalized Spatial Audio\",\"Transparency Mode\",\"USB-C Charging\",\"Digital Crown Control\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Apple AirPods Max Midnight Blue USB-C\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/6b04713c8b53e0942621d6d594841a0097d23ba3-1355x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":1799,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Seamless Apple pairing\",\"Incredible build quality\",\"Best transparency mode\"],\"rating\":4.3,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":127,\"slug\":\"apple-airpods-max-usb-c-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Apple AirPods Max (USB-C) Headphone\",\"verdict\":\"The ultimate luxury choice for iPhone users. The build quality is unmatched, and the Transparency Mode is so natural it feels like you aren't wearing headphones.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":3,\"whySelected\":\"For iPhone users, the ecosystem integration is magic. The build quality and Transparency Mode are unmatched in the industry.\"},{\"_key\":\"916d4c5862b7\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Battery King\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/45IoPrW\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Sennheiser\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Touch controls can be finicky\",\"ANC weaker than Sony\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.2,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"60-Hour Battery\",\"Audiophile Sound\",\"Adaptive ANC\",\"Smart Control App\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sennheiser Momentum 4 Black Wireless Headphones\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/88be18c415000a243c1f8e7f1abb277a96befd4b-1093x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":849,\"priceTier\":\"Mid-Range\",\"pros\":[\"Insane battery life\",\"Rich sound quality\",\"Great value price\"],\"rating\":4.2,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":8888,\"slug\":\"sennheiser-momentum-4-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Sennheiser Momentum 4 Wireless Headphone\",\"verdict\":\"The battery beast. With 60 hours of playtime, you can fly from Dubai to Los Angeles and back twice without charging. The sound quality is audiophile-grade.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":4,\"whySelected\":\"A massive 60-hour battery life destroys the competition. Perfect for travelers who hate charging their devices.\"},{\"_key\":\"f476db3ac258\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Travel Value\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4qRTISN\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Soundcore\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Bulky design\",\"Bass can be overpowering\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.3,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"50-Hour Playtime\",\"LDAC Hi-Res Audio\",\"App Control\",\"Fast Charging\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Soundcore Space Q45 Black Headphones\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/476f0642bc6649b16b0a4ed93d1c7c7ef0efb2b4-1210x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":289,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Unbeatable price/performance\",\"Great app EQ\",\"Long battery\"],\"rating\":4.3,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":13525,\"slug\":\"soundcore-space-q45-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Soundcore Space Q45 by Anker Wireless Headphone\",\"verdict\":\"The best value travel headphone. It offers LDAC High-Res audio and solid noise cancellation for a fraction of the price of Sony or Bose.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":5,\"whySelected\":\"Offers premium features like LDAC audio and adaptive ANC for a fraction of the price of the big brands.\"},{\"_key\":\"421527686fd4\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Mid-Range\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4pDYOkz\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Sony\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Plasticky build\",\"No carry case included\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.2,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Integrated Processor V1\",\"Lightweight Design\",\"35-Hour Battery\",\"Multipoint Connection\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sony WH-CH720N Black lightweight headphones\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/ec6e21fbe88ba76a4b38cb282dd514d4315559ad-715x970.jpg\"},\"price\":294,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Very light (comfortable)\",\"Flagship processor chip\",\"Affordable Sony tech\"],\"rating\":4.2,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":14187,\"slug\":\"sony-wh-ch720n-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Sony WH-CH720N Noise Cancelling Headphone\",\"verdict\":\"The lightest option on our list. It uses the same V1 Processor as the expensive XM5s, giving you premium processing in a lightweight, affordable plastic body.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":6,\"whySelected\":\"Uses the flagship V1 chip from the expensive Sony models but packages it in a lightweight, affordable chassis.\"},{\"_key\":\"a9758aa6e2c3\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Bass\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4sKFWTK\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"JBL\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Earcups can be tight\",\"Mic is average\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.3,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"JBL Pure Bass\",\"70-Hour Battery\",\"Bluetooth 5.3\",\"VoiceAware\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"JBL Tune 770NC White Headphones\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/7603929c2f81c564a70e04e650bd9e2bea7cb72a-1372x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":249,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Punchy bass\",\"Huge battery life\",\"Very affordable\"],\"rating\":4.3,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":26490,\"slug\":\"jbl-tune-770nc-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"JBL Tune 770NC Wireless Headphone\",\"verdict\":\"A solid daily driver with that signature JBL Pure Bass sound. Great for students and commuters who want reliable ANC and fun, punchy audio.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":7,\"whySelected\":\"Signature JBL Pure Bass sound combined with a huge 70-hour battery makes this the fun, energetic choice.\"},{\"_key\":\"9842aa0ba034\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Budget\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4t1iDWf\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Soundcore\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Build quality is fragile\",\"Sound leaks at high volume\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.5,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Hybrid ANC\",\"40-Hour Playtime\",\"NFC Pairing\",\"Transport/Outdoor Modes\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Soundcore Life Q30 Black\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/29c50a58537b57b13b9599a52952204e52f1d8dd-1119x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":179,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Cheapest good ANC\",\"Hi-Res certified\",\"Comfortable earcups\"],\"rating\":4.5,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":89877,\"slug\":\"soundcore-life-q30-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Soundcore Life Q30 Hybrid Headphone\",\"verdict\":\"The absolute budget king. For under AED 200, you get Hi-Res audio, an App with EQ, and decent ANC. It's the best entry-level choice.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":8,\"whySelected\":\"The #1 bestseller for a reason. It delivers genuine Hi-Res audio and decent noise cancellation for under AED 200.\"},{\"_key\":\"c5e431737f7b\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Style\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4qV6Vub\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Marshall\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Passive isolation only (No ANC)\",\"On-ear pressure\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.6,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"100+ Hours Playtime\",\"Wireless Charging\",\"Customizable M-Button\",\"Rugged Design\"],\"loc